  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nIf you have a \"Dracoslayer\" or \"Majespecter\"
    card in your other Pendulum Zone: You can add 1 \"Dracoslayer\" Pendulum Monster
    with a different original name than that card from your Deck to your hand, then
    you can destroy 1 card in your Pendulum Zone. You can only use this effect of
    \"Majesty Pegasus, the Dracoslayer\" once per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \n(This
    card is always treated as a \"Majespecter\" card.)\r\n(Quick Effect): You can
    discard this card; for the rest of this turn, your opponent cannot target \"Dracoslayer\"
    monsters you control with card effects, also they cannot be destroyed by your
    opponent's card effects. If this card is Special Summoned by the effect of a
    \"Dracoslayer\" card, or Pendulum Summoned: You can add 1 Field Spell from your
    Deck to your hand, then discard 1 card. You can only use this effect of \"Majesty
    Pegasus, the Dracoslayer\" once per turn."
